<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: Black">Indicate
by check mark whether the registrant is an emerging growth company as defined in Rule 405 of the Securities Act of 1933 (CFR &#167;230.405
of this chapter) or Rule 12b-2 of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934 (CFR &#167;240.12b-2 of this chapter). Emerging growth company
<span id="xdx_900_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20231022__20231022_zz14WxRRKh53"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2023-10-22" format="ixt:booleanfalse" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#9744;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

